1
00:00:00,387 --> 00:00:03,217
(Amy:)Wow, my boyfriend is friends
with Stephen Hawking...

2
00:00:03,456 --> 00:00:06,786
(Amy:)...and my new dandruff shampoo
doesn't smell like tar.

3
00:00:07,661 --> 00:00:10,601
(Amy:)Everything really is coming up Amy.

4
00:00:11,665 --> 00:00:13,135
(Sheldon:)It is glorious.

5
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:15,393
(Sheldon:)One of the greatest intellects
of our time...

6
00:00:15,635 --> 00:00:19,005
(Sheldon:)...has agreed to engage with me
in a gentlemanly battle of wits.

7
00:00:19,205 --> 00:00:24,165
(Sheldon:)And I'm spanking him so hard, his grad
students won't be able to sit down.

8
00:00:25,011 --> 00:00:29,111
(Amy:)You know, when one male dominates
another, his testosterone level rises.

9
00:00:29,983 --> 00:00:32,073
- What's your point?
- It's exciting to think...

10
00:00:32,252 --> 00:00:34,382
(Amy:)...you might be getting
a testosterone level.

11
00:00:40,026 --> 00:00:44,516
Ooh! My friend Stephen just played
the word "act" for 18 points.

12
00:00:44,731 --> 00:00:47,431
(Sheldon:)That's right, I call him Stephen now.

13
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:51,197
(Sheldon:)Because I checked,
and he was not okay with Wheels.

14
00:00:52,072 --> 00:00:54,402
Oh. You could turn his "act" into "extract"...

15
00:00:54,574 --> 00:00:56,544
(Amy:)...and it would be for double points.

16
00:00:56,743 --> 00:00:59,213
(Sheldon:)Amy, why would you give me a word?

